  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This is a small change, but in my opinion it's essential. If I add a world to favorites it's because they are worlds that I visit often and I want a quick shortcut to enter, the problem is that every time I have to scroll through six lists before arriving to favorites (counting that when I'm writing this post is also present the \"Winter 2018\" list). So I have to wait that it load the first 6 lists and eventually I can finally access my favorites, which can often take up to 30 seconds when I start VRChat. Maybe it's a stupid thing that annoys only me, but I find that having the favourites as first or second is more correct than the current order, even if I imagine that this order has been created in such a way as to encourage players to explore new worlds, but for those who often go to favorites after a while it's always annoying to scroll down to join a world you go often",
